        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 86724, 6 Inch Clear Glass Bar Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Crystal Bar Cabinet Pull is perfect for all mid-century modern home remodels. It is made out of kiln-fired molded glass with brass bases. A limited release, the 6 Inch Clear Glass Bar Pull was artfully crafted and shows both style and romance. It comes packaged with the mounting hardware. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86724-specifications.gif?v=1704354557\" width=\"600\" height=\"144\" border=\"0\" atl=\"Emtek 86724 specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Crystal Bar Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Clear Glass with Brass Base</li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 6\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Center to Center: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-10-Finish.jpg?v=1704354500\" width=\"600\" height=\"77\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
